<title>USA: Advanced Radio president resigns.</title>
<headline>Advanced Radio president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Radio Telecom Corp on Friday said Steven Comrie, its president and chief operating officer, resigned to pursue entrepreneurial ventures.</p>
<p>The company said Vernon Fotheringham, chairman and chief executive officer, has assumed the office of president. Thomas Grina, executive vice president and chief financial officer, was appointed chief operating officer.</p>
</text>
